<h2>The class everybody thought they were in</h2>
<p>Bookings come through messages and the front desk. A student turns up on a pass that ended last week. Another believes she has three classes left, but nobody can check. The instructor does not know who is coming until the room fills.</p>
<h2>What goes wrong in a studio</h2>
<ul><li>Class passes and memberships tracked in a notebook.</li><li>Expiry and balances nobody can verify at the door.</li><li>Instructor and room schedules kept apart from bookings.</li></ul>
